      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"These federal agencies, these great, supposed supporters, are not the strong backbone of a nation; they are the very **leach and the mold** that is turning our American spirit to dust.\n\n They are a parasitic machine, built on endless top-down consensus, and the only consensus it truly upholds is the right of the elite to control and to profit from the very life force of the common citizen.\n\n The regulations, the endless red tape, they are not the necessary guardrails of a strong state; **they are the very concrete that is crushing the drive, the the fundamental, God-given right to *do and to build for yourself",
      "source": "target",
